# Python bytecode and pytest's cache, from the wrapper kernel in kernel/ and
# the protocol tests. The bytecode is pinned to one CPython version, and
# scripts/build-phar.php copies kernel/ into the archive, so a stale .pyc would
# ship inside the PHAR and land beside every kernelspec a PHAR install writes.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/.pytest_cache/
